<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Panic button auto euls/dagger out/glimmer</Major>
    <Description>This panic button is very effective when people jump on you. I recommend turn off quick cast to work properly because 2x click on dagger is redirected to base. Works well with euls/glimmer/bkb

Just edit the key to your own hotkey

I recommend putting the macro to mouse4 and it will press your keybind to the item

Suggestions and feedbacks are welcome @trigago on forums

Happy Gaming!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 6 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 6 1
Delay 5 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Dota 2</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>